        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"cf80eeb7-3b48-4274-87d9-b694cb853c50\",\"review_text\":\"Fire 🔥🔥\"},{\"review_id\":\"e9788186-ca8d-4094-99b8-b625677cd9a9\",\"review_text\":\"⁰0\"},{\"review_id\":\"c22dff0f-ab65-4d72-8309-15fda1e2f92c\",\"review_text\":\"It's great love it\"},{\"review_id\":\"87d7c6a4-7164-490f-b8a5-ee7513aaa346\",\"review_text\":\"Love,my new favorite music app\"},{\"review_id\":\"75b078a7-193c-40c0-9bf9-a3db1ccd8cfb\",\"review_text\":\"Cool app\"},{\"review_id\":\"609ba38d-f4be-4519-ab06-faf8a0606476\",\"review_text\":\"If you don't pay you can't use it. It stops playing every couple of songs and you have to go back in and press play every time. It's a pain because when you're working you can't keep going to your phone every 5 min. Might as well download a local radio app at least it won't stop every minute. And their free to listen to.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a9ddad52-3fb5-4f8a-b703-56e558c586ea\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this application. Just waste of time too many adds in it. Disappointed l\"},{\"review_id\":\"9862f0b7-dc85-4251-95c3-5eab5097888a\",\"review_text\":\"Old school to latest fine dine, n funky music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f00b631d-ba90-4021-9e7f-7eb848a91813\",\"review_text\":\"I uninstalled this app because the new version is very bad like no loop and you. Can't go to the main part of the song and many more .\"},{\"review_id\":\"65706594-3545-44c7-a68e-1f638bcb937e\",\"review_text\":\"Riya sen\"}]}"
